{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act51side_level_act51side_08_beg","storyGroup":"act51side","storySort":16,"storyDependence":"act51side_level_act51side_07_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"PA-8","storyName":"一千年后","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"决战前夕，安托沙将写好的信件交给乌克西克，并讲述了自己的往事。随后，马特维把熟睡的乌克西克托付给了索尼娅。绝望的巴普洛维奇得到了特别的“帮助”，大战一触即发。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act51side/level_act51side_08_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act51side_08","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":14,"next":16,"characters":["尤拉","乌克西克","安托沙","马特维","兴奋的学生","烈夏","凛冬","谨慎的学生","？？？","巴普洛维奇","安保队长","乌萨斯军官","“十六勇士”暴徒"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":4},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_bg_bg_oldwarehouse_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":7},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_calm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":8,"musicid":0},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2184_1#3$1","duration":"1","id":9},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":10},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2184_1#3$1","id":11},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤拉","text":"不对，不能这么写。","id":12},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2184_1#4$1","id":13},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤拉","text":"“用一层雪水，擦拭灰色的街道”？“拿来一盒受潮的烟”？不对，都不对！","id":14},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":15},{"type":"text","text":"他对着微弱的月光，拿起满是印子的草稿，不禁抱怨灵感枯竭的自己——这首诗还不如一旁熟睡的同学那含糊的梦话。","id":16},{"type":"text","text":"经历大火后，无缚者同盟的营地异常平静，冬风像是在用钝刀刮蹭年轻人们稚嫩的脸颊。","id":17},{"type":"text","text":"尚有精力的年轻人窃窃私语着，他们裹紧散发着霉味的大衣，在夜色下就像一个个土包，时不时发出几阵笑声。","id":18},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2184_1#2$1","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤拉","text":"......请给每一颗星星，一个能够记住的名字。","id":20},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤拉","text":"请给想要遗忘的人，一杯最廉价的烈酒。","id":21},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤拉","text":"请给我......","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤拉","text":"请给我一张去往春天的单程票......","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤拉","text":"可以让我住进，穿过苔原的风里。","id":24},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":25},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4224_turdus_1#4$1","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌克西克","text":"吓——","id":27},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2184_1#5$1","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤拉","text":"？！","id":29},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2184_1#2$1","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤拉","text":"果然是你......我发誓，总有一天我会对你所有的恶作剧免疫。","id":31},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4224_turdus_1#2$1","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌克西克","text":"又在写那些酸掉牙的诗了，尤拉。","id":33},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2184_1#2$1","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤拉","text":"每首诗可都是我费尽心血写的，才不是什么酸诗，你看得懂吗？","id":35},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4224_turdus_1#2$1","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌克西克","text":"我才不想看懂，你们这些能看得懂的人每天都愁眉苦脸的。","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌克西克","text":"何况马特维才教我识了几行字，我能看懂地址就不错了。反正大家写什么，最后还不是要靠我送出去。","id":38},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4224_turdus_1#4$1","id":39},{"type":"multiline","name":"乌克西克","text":"说说吧尤拉，这次要我帮你送给哪个姑娘？","id":40},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_knock_head","id":41},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.2","xstrength":"0","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":42},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4224_turdus_1#10$1","id":43},{"type":"multiline","name":"乌克西克","text":"哎哟——","id":44},{"type":"dialog","id":45},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2184_1#2$1","id":46},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper1","id":47},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤拉","text":"送给你的，你这个小鬼！","id":49},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4224_turdus_1#10$1","id":50},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌克西克","text":"你竟敢打小孩！我要收走这张纸，你别想再写了！","id":51},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2184_1#2$1","id":52},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤拉","text":"好啦好啦，就是拿纸筒打了下，哪有那么夸张......不过你想要，就拿去吧。","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤拉","text":"这次......我是写给大家的，当然你也有份。","id":54},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4224_turdus_1#2$1","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌克西克","text":"奇奇怪怪的......那我放包里了。","id":56},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2184_1#2$1","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤拉","text":"不说这些了，乌克西克。","id":58},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤拉","text":"安托沙那里好像有很多信，我想，你得去找他一趟。","id":59},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4224_turdus_1#2$1","id":60},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌克西克","text":"他不是每晚都和你们一起吃饭休息吗？我怎么没在这里看到他？","id":61},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2184_1#2$1","id":62},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤拉","text":"我哪知道？反正他就在里边，能问出原由的话，你也帮我问问他。","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤拉","text":"对了，把大衣扣紧一点，你要是冻着了，安托沙又要骂人。","id":64},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4224_turdus_1#6$1","id":65},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌克西克","text":"嗯？他可从来不骂我。","id":66},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4224_turdus_1#2$1","id":67},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌克西克","text":"再见了，尤拉。","id":68},{"type":"dialog","id":69},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":70},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-200,0","duration":"1","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":71},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":72},{"type":"charslot","id":73},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2184_1#2$1","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤拉","text":"因为他骂的是我们，小鬼......","id":75},{"type":"dialog","id":76},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":77},{"type":"charslot","id":78},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":79},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_bg_bg_oldwarehouse_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":80},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":81},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":82},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4224_turdus_1#4$1","duration":"0.5","id":83},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌克西克","text":"安托沙，我来啦。","id":85},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2157_1#2$1","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"......不用每次都喊得那么大声，乌克西克。","id":87},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4224_turdus_1#2$1","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌克西克","text":"尤拉和我说，你有些信件要交给我。在哪儿呢？","id":89},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2157_1#2$1","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"是，有些多。","id":91},{"type":"dialog","id":92},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":93},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":94},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":95},{"type":"text","text":"他走到角落，抱起厚厚一摞信件。","id":96},{"type":"charslot","id":97},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4224_turdus_1#10$1","id":98},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌克西克","text":"好麻烦......我先看看。","id":99},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper1","id":100},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4224_turdus_1#6$1","id":101},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌克西克","text":"这第一封，送到奥多耶夫区老街的34号？第二封送到铁河区左岸街的15号，第三封送到香料市场的......","id":102},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4224_turdus_1#1$1","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌克西克","text":"等等安托沙，这些信都是你写的？这些地址都是什么地方？","id":104},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2157_1#2$1","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"奥多耶夫区老街的34号，是尤拉的家，然后是小列夫和维萨里昂的......","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"我为每一个人都写了信，等我们打倒了那个枢密官后你再看看，需要送出多少封。","id":107},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2157_1#11$1","id":108},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"如果有人倒在明天，至少......我不希望他们的家人，是从乌萨斯给出的伤亡名单上知道他们的消息。","id":109},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4224_turdus_1#9$1","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌克西克","text":"......你是什么时候记下这些的？","id":111},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2157_1#5$1","id":112},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"有人把命交给我的时候，我必须要知道这些命是从哪里来的......这是忘不掉的。","id":113},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2157_1#2$1","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"还记得吗？当初我也问过你的出身。","id":115},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4224_turdus_1#1$1","id":116},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌克西克","text":"只不过你没想到，我是一个连名字都没有的孤儿？","id":117},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2157_1#11$1","id":118},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"......","id":119},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4224_turdus_1#2$1","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌克西克","text":"好啦，你这是什么表情？","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌克西克","text":"我自己都没有像你这样愁过，何况今天我还帮你省了一张纸呢。","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌克西克","text":"说起来，这些信里，也有你和马特维的吗？","id":123},{"type":"dialog","id":124},{"type":"charslot","id":125},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","id":126},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"1","id":127},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2160_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":128},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马特维","text":"说不定会有我的，但绝不会有他的。","id":130},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4224_turdus_1#2$1","id":131},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌克西克","text":"马特维？","id":132},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2160_1#1$1","id":133},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马特维","text":"要做什么大事前，我和他习惯单独聚一聚。","id":134},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2157_1#2$1","id":135},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"翻到啤酒了吗？","id":136},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_bottlecollide","id":137},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2160_1#1$1","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马特维","text":"最后两瓶，不知道被谁藏在了那堆烂菜叶里。不过今晚整理装备的时候，利斯特还是闻出来了。","id":139},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2157_1#2$1","id":140},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"......给我一瓶。","id":141},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4224_turdus_1#2$1","id":142},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌克西克","text":"马特维，我也能尝一尝吗？正好有些口渴——","id":143},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2160_1#9$1","id":144},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马特维","text":"你才多大？休想。","id":145},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4224_turdus_1#10$1","id":146},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌克西克","text":"小气！","id":147},{"type":"charslot","id":148},{"type":"text","text":"马特维轻轻地拍了一下女孩的头，接着他坐在了安托沙身旁，递去一个玻璃瓶。","id":149},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4224_turdus_1#2$1","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌克西克","text":"不过马特维，你为什么说安托沙不会给自己家里写信呢？","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌克西克","text":"他要是觉得自己不会死，又何必让我去送信？难道他不敢？","id":152},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2160_1#1$1","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马特维","text":"哈哈，那怎么可能......","id":154},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2160_1#3$1","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马特维","text":"只是他和家里，已经很久没有联系了。","id":156},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2160_1#2$1","id":157},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马特维","text":"安托沙？","id":158},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2157_1#5$1","id":159},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"无妨，都是些往事罢了。","id":160},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2160_1#1$1","id":161},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马特维","text":"我们刚认识不久的时候，有一次我和其他人谈到了安托沙。","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马特维","text":"我无意间称呼他为“安东·舍斯托夫”，正好被他路过听到，他耿耿于怀了一个月。","id":163},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4224_turdus_1#6$1","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌克西克","text":"安东·舍斯托夫？听起来像是某个贵族老爷。","id":165},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2157_1#2$1","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"上大学前，我就舍弃了这个名字，也离开了为我起这个名字的人。","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"或许现在看来，比起失去一个儿子，他们恐怕更庆幸自己摆脱了一个会惹事的叛徒。","id":168},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4224_turdus_1#1$1","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌克西克","text":"我第一次听说安托沙家人的事......","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌克西克","text":"他们对你不好吗？","id":171},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2157_1#5$1","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"我的祖父......那个杀了欺压自己的地主起家，最后成为伯爵荣归故里的人。","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"小时候我憧憬他那样的“英雄”，于是就学着传闻中的事迹，去与佃农们同吃同住，和每一个所谓的“下人”都交了朋友。","id":174},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2157_1#10$1","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"家里怪我不成体统，我从来不在意，因为我相信至少祖父会理解我。","id":176},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2157_1#11$1","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"直到我长大，了解到许多......","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"比如有一位老农户，不小心撞倒了他。作为惩罚，祖父强迫那个老人，当着我们的面掐死自己养了几年的鼷兽。","id":179},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2160_1#4$1","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马特维","text":"安托沙，如果你不想说——","id":181},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2157_1#5$1","id":182},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"我始终抱着一丝幻想，直到那一晚......祖父举办了盛大的家宴，庆祝我考上圣骏堡的大学。","id":183},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"一位和我差不多年纪的女仆，溜进厨房里拿走了不少食物，想让自己的母亲和弟弟也尝尝贵族家的大餐。","id":184},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2157_1#2$1","id":185},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"警察想要带走她，但我祖父拒绝了。","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"他笑着说：“今天是好日子，我要让所有人都能因我孙子的荣耀而感到幸福。”","id":187},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4224_turdus_1#1$1","id":188},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌克西克","text":"......","id":189},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2157_1#11$1","id":190},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"过了两天，我前往圣骏堡的时候，在郊外看到了一具满是鞭痕的尸体。","id":191},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"管家告诉我，如果让警察带走她，最多关几天而已......只有贵族的“体罚权”，才能给她“真正的教训”。","id":192},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2157_1#10$1","id":193},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"不过，得到教训的是我——每当我闭上双眼，就会想起在她睫毛上攀爬的虫蝇。","id":194},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2157_1#1$1","id":195},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"于是我知道，只要还有人是贵族，只要抗争的结果还是会把人变成贵族，压迫就永远不会消失。","id":196},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4224_turdus_1#2$1","id":197},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌克西克","text":"......安托沙，我想跟你说。","id":198},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌克西克","text":"最悲苦的日子，已经过去了，我们......会胜利的。","id":199},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2157_1#11$1","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"......","id":201},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4224_turdus_1#5$1","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌克西克","text":"反正，明天、明天就，我——","id":203},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.5","id":204},{"type":"text","text":"她大着舌头嘟囔出最后这几个词，脑袋一歪，砸在马特维肩上，昏睡了过去。","id":205},{"type":"text","text":"安托沙意识到了什么，他一把夺过乌克西克怀里抱着的酒瓶，里面已经空空荡荡。","id":206},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2157_1#3$1","id":207},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"乌克西克——我还在想，你什么时候学会说那种安慰人的话了。","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"居然敢偷偷喝我的酒......马特维，你也不看着点。","id":209},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2160_1#1$1","id":210},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马特维","text":"算了......别吵醒她，正好我还不知道该怎么哄她离开。","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马特维","text":"是时候带她走了。","id":212},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2160_1#2$1","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马特维","text":"不过，你知道，我们要去的地方是......","id":214},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2157_1#4$1","id":215},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"呵......","id":216},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"我来帮你。","id":217},{"type":"dialog","id":218},{"type":"charslot","id":219},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","id":220},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4224_turdus_1#5$1","afrom":"0","ato":"0","posfrom":"-130,50","posto":"-130,80","id":221},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"0.9","duration":"0","id":222},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"-120,50","posto":"-120,100","duration":"0.5","afrom":"0","ato":"1","id":223},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2160_1#1$1","posfrom":"0,-30","posto":"0,0","duration":"0.5","id":224},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":225},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马特维","text":"说真的......你也为我写了信吗？","id":226},{"type":"charslot","id":227},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2157_1#4$1","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"不需要，我相信你。","id":229},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"-120,100","posto":"-120,100","name":"avg_4224_turdus_1#5$1","id":230},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"0.9","duration":"0","id":231},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2160_1#1$1","id":232},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马特维","text":"......","id":233},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马特维","text":"前段时间，乌克西克还能钻洞出去的时候，我倒是写了一封信，让她带给了我的妈妈。","id":234},{"type":"charslot","id":235},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2157_1#4$1","id":236},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"你写了什么？","id":237},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"-120,100","posto":"-120,100","name":"avg_4224_turdus_1#5$1","id":238},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"0.9","duration":"0","id":239},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2160_1#10$1","id":240},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马特维","text":"“最多再有十天，我们就能离开这个鬼地方，回一趟城里。”","id":241},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2160_1#1$1","id":242},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马特维","text":"总算要出发了，我的朋友。","id":243},{"type":"charslot","id":244},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2157_1#10$1","id":245},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"......","id":246},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2157_1#2$1","id":247},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"记得回来。","id":248},{"type":"charslot","id":249},{"type":"text","text":"马特维闭上了眼睛，点点头。","id":250},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2157_1#4$1","id":251},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"晚安，马特维......","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"等到黎明时分，我们再见。","id":253},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":254},{"type":"dialog","id":255},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":256},{"type":"charslot","id":257},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":258},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":259},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":260},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":261},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_tara_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":262,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2180_1#2$1","duration":"0.5","id":263},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"兴奋的学生","text":"还要多久啊，罗莎琳？你摆弄一晚上了。","id":265},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_194_leto_1#4$1","id":266},{"type":"dialogue","name":"烈夏","text":"别催啦，我修的是吉他，又不是碎布娃娃。","id":267,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2d/Avg_avg_194_leto_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"烈夏","text":"你们从垃圾堆里刨出来的，琴轴没一个是好的，哪能修得那么快？","id":268,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2d/Avg_avg_194_leto_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2180_1#2$1","id":269},{"type":"dialogue","name":"兴奋的学生","text":"这不是明天就得干大事了嘛，能弹一个音是一个音。","id":270},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_194_leto_1#6$1","id":271},{"type":"dialogue","name":"烈夏","text":"啧......把钳子递给我。","id":272,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_194_leto_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":273},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":274},{"type":"charslot","id":275},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":276},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":277},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":278},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":279},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#1$2","duration":"1","id":280},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":281},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"......都检查过了吗？","id":282},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2178_1#1$1","id":283},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谨慎的学生","text":"都检查过了，那栋楼很安全，伤员安置在那里没有问题。","id":284},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#1$2","id":285},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"很好，你去找米科拉，再检查一遍我们在街道两侧的布置。","id":286},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"确保万无一失，明白了吗？","id":287},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2178_1#1$1","id":288},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谨慎的学生","text":"明白！","id":289},{"type":"charslot","id":290},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"......我又来得不是时候吗，索尼娅？","id":291},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#6$2","id":292},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"马特维？","id":293},{"type":"dialog","id":294},{"type":"charslot","id":295},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2160_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":296},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":297},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#1$2","id":298},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"你怎么来了？你们那边出什么状况了吗？有什么我们能做的？","id":299},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2160_1#1$1","id":300},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马特维","text":"多谢，我们很好。","id":301},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马特维","text":"先前安托沙把话说到那个份上......以他的脾气饿死都不会来求你的。","id":302},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马特维","text":"我是为了这个孩子。","id":303},{"type":"dialog","id":304},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"-120,100","posto":"-120,100","name":"avg_4224_turdus_1#5$1","duration":"1","id":305},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"0.9","duration":"0","id":306},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2160_1#1$1","id":307},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":308},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":309},{"type":"text","text":"他微微侧身，露出身后呼呼大睡的女孩。","id":310},{"type":"charslot","id":311},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#10$2","id":312},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"这味道......","id":313},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"-120,100","posto":"-120,100","name":"avg_4224_turdus_1#5$1","id":314},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"0.9","duration":"0","id":315},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2160_1#9$1","id":316},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马特维","text":"趁我不注意，她偷偷喝了酒。","id":317},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2160_1#1$1","id":318},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马特维","text":"所以现在，我想把她交给你。从人手和作战计划来看，她在你这边会更安全。","id":319},{"type":"charslot","id":320},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#4$2","id":321},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"......","id":322},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#1$2","id":323},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"罗莎琳那里还有几张软垫，你过去找她吧。","id":324},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"-120,100","posto":"-120,100","name":"avg_4224_turdus_1#5$1","id":325},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"0.9","duration":"0","id":326},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2160_1#5$1","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马特维","text":"呼......","id":328},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2160_1#1$1","id":329},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马特维","text":"谢谢你，真的。","id":330},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马特维","text":"我原本担心，你们那次争吵......","id":331},{"type":"charslot","id":332},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#1$2","id":333},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"他的做法或许有些冷酷......但没有人能否认，你们都是纯粹的勇士。","id":334},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"-120,100","posto":"-120,100","name":"avg_4224_turdus_1#5$1","id":335},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"0.9","duration":"0","id":336},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2160_1#3$1","id":337},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马特维","text":"曾经的安托沙......会更热情一些。","id":338},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马特维","text":"虽然刚认识的时候我就知道他是个怪人，明明举止都是大贵族的做派，却拉着老师问哪里可以打零工。","id":339},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马特维","text":"后来老师带着他，写文章批评贵族政治，当时的议会非但没处罚，还把老师提拔成了督学。","id":340},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2160_1#2$1","id":341},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马特维","text":"那天，安托沙拉着我的手，说乌萨斯终于有希望了，以后不再会有受苦的人，我们都能获得自由。","id":342},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马特维","text":"为了纪念那一刻，他还和我在学校的花园里，种下了一棵樱桃树。","id":343},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2160_1#10$1","id":344},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马特维","text":"直到我们的报刊被查处，老师也因我们而死......","id":345},{"type":"charslot","id":346},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#1$2","id":347},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"你们......","id":348},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"-120,100","posto":"-120,100","name":"avg_4224_turdus_1#5$1","id":349},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"0.9","duration":"0","id":350},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2160_1#2$1","id":351},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马特维","text":"我们被开除了，老师扛下了主要的罪责，换来乌萨斯对我们的“宽大处理”。","id":352},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马特维","text":"离开学校的前一天，安托沙倚靠在那棵樱桃树前，抚摸着没长出叶子的树枝，坐了一个晚上。","id":353},{"type":"charslot","id":354},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#4$2","id":355},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"......","id":356},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"-120,100","posto":"-120,100","name":"avg_4224_turdus_1#5$1","id":357},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"0.9","duration":"0","id":358},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2160_1#1$1","id":359},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马特维","text":"我该去找罗莎琳了，再一次谢谢你。","id":360},{"type":"charslot","id":361},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#1$2","id":362},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"马特维，等等。","id":363},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"既然你说留在这里更加安全......","id":364},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"那么你自己不留下吗？","id":365},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"-120,100","posto":"-120,100","name":"avg_4224_turdus_1#5$1","id":366},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"0.9","duration":"0","id":367},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2160_1#2$1","id":368},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马特维","text":"不了，有一个约定，我今晚刚答应下来。","id":369},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2160_1#1$1","id":370},{"type":"dialogue","name":"马特维","text":"......也许是更早的时候。","id":371},{"type":"dialog","id":372},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":373},{"type":"charslot","id":374},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":375},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":376},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":377},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":378},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2180_1#1$1","id":379},{"type":"dialogue","name":"兴奋的学生","text":"这是......成功了？","id":380},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_194_leto_1#8$1","id":381},{"type":"dialogue","name":"烈夏","text":"我试试。","id":382,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_194_leto_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":383},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_wdnguitarstrum","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","id":384},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"0.5","id":385},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":386},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_194_leto_1#8$1","id":387},{"type":"dialogue","name":"烈夏","text":"虽然音准有些偏，但好歹能听个响了。","id":388,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_194_leto_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2180_1#2$1","id":389},{"type":"dialogue","name":"兴奋的学生","text":"好欸！我就说罗莎琳是个真正的天才！","id":390},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_194_leto_1#1$1","id":391},{"type":"dialogue","name":"烈夏","text":"这时候知道恭维我了？有这个工夫，不如想想要听点什么。","id":392,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_194_leto_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2180_1#2$1","id":393},{"type":"dialogue","name":"兴奋的学生","text":"呃......《故乡的河流之上》？或者什么莱塔尼亚有什么......","id":394},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_194_leto_1#5$1","id":395},{"type":"dialogue","name":"烈夏","text":"哈？那些软绵绵的我才不要弹。","id":396,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_194_leto_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_194_leto_1#8$1","id":397},{"type":"dialogue","name":"烈夏","text":"这样，我来即兴弹几个和弦，你们随便唱点应景的东西。","id":398,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_194_leto_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2180_1#2$1","id":399},{"type":"dialogue","name":"兴奋的学生","text":"这是不是太难了？","id":400},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_194_leto_1#4$1","id":401},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":402},{"type":"dialogue","name":"烈夏","text":"你们那么多学文学的，都学到哪里去了？赶紧想词儿，要开始了。","id":403,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2d/Avg_avg_194_leto_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_194_leto_1#11$1","id":404},{"type":"dialogue","name":"烈夏","text":"一、二、三......","id":405,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/db/Avg_avg_194_leto_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":406},{"type":"playmusic","volume":"0.6","id":407,"musicid":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":408},{"type":"charslot","id":409},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":410},{"type":"text","text":"......","id":411},{"type":"text","text":"我们踩断寒铁织就的蛛网♪","id":412},{"type":"text","text":"我们剥落夜的坚甲♪","id":413},{"type":"text","text":"只为了♪","id":414},{"type":"text","text":"让芽尖挣开冻土的壳♪","id":415},{"type":"text","text":"代替守望雪中虚假的晨光♪","id":416},{"type":"dialog","id":417},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":418},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌克西克","text":"嗯哼......这声音......","id":419},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌克西克","text":"......马特维？","id":420},{"type":"dialog","id":421},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":422},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":423},{"type":"dialog","id":424},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":425},{"type":"charslot","id":426},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":427},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_bg_bg_ltroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":428},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":429},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":430},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$nervous_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_nervous_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":431,"musicid":3},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#8$2","duration":"0.5","id":432},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":433},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"还没有消息吗？","id":434},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"这都几点了？啊？","id":435},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":436},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安保队长","text":"枢密官大人，那两条路上的警戒塔我们都加固了，但是——","id":437},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":438},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#5$2","id":439},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"我问警戒塔了吗？我问的是增援，是补给！","id":440},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#8$2","id":441},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"达尼拉·特里波列夫......答应我的弩箭呢？重炮呢？战车呢？军队呢？","id":442},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":443},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#5$2","id":444},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"派了一万封信，他一个字都不回，他怎么敢这样！","id":445},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":446},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安保队长","text":"请冷静，大人，我们几位配备了精良的弩箭，还有备用的弹射飞行装置，至少能保障您的生命安全。","id":447},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#8$2","id":448},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"“冷静”？“你们几位”？","id":449},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"你是想告诉我，我请你们过来，就为了让我捡一条命好去支付你们的账单？我逃出去他们会放过我？那和死了有什么区别？","id":450},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"“队长大人”，你们如果想拿到钱，就全都得给我上，干掉那些愣头青！","id":451},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":452},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安保队长","text":"可您的钱也就够请我们这几个人，还送了些弟兄给格罗莫夫，而他们有几百人——","id":453},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#8$2","id":454},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"我还要你提醒我吗？听听，他们的歌声都传进来了。","id":455},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#5$2","id":456},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"他们在唱丧歌给我听！","id":457},{"type":"dialog","id":458},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":459},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorknockquite","id":460},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":461},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#3$2","id":462},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"......是哪位？","id":463},{"type":"dialog","id":464},{"type":"charslot","id":465},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1977_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":466},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":467},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌萨斯军官","text":"晚上好，枢密官大人，我是契切林上尉。","id":468,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌萨斯军官","text":"想必您这里物资充盈，炉子烧得这么热，让您流了不少汗。","id":469,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#4$2","id":470},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"你......不不，您是特里波列夫公爵大人派来支援我的？快，快请坐。","id":471},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1977_1#1$1","id":472},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌萨斯军官","text":"不，大人，公爵大人对卡托加区已经失去了兴趣。","id":473,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#4$2","id":474},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"为什么？！","id":475},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1977_1#1$1","id":476},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌萨斯军官","text":"我不能揣测公爵大人的想法，这是规矩。","id":477,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌萨斯军官","text":"不过，虽说我不是那位大人所派遣的，但我确实是来支援您的。","id":478,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#2$2","id":479},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"好......好，我为了乌萨斯尽心尽责地治理卡托加区，我就知道国家一定会奖励我的忠心。","id":480},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"您带了多少士兵？多少重武器？您可以随意挑选地方架设，就算把大炮拉进这个房间都可以，拜托您了。","id":481},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1977_1#1$1","id":482},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌萨斯军官","text":"枢密官大人，您好像误会了。","id":483,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌萨斯军官","text":"我没有士兵，上司只让我带了三十名军警，自然也不会有什么重武器。","id":484,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#4$2","id":485},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"什么？！","id":486},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1977_1#1$1","id":487},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌萨斯军官","text":"不过他为您准备了这个。","id":488,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":489},{"type":"text","text":"军官从公文包里掏出了一个黑色的、巴掌大小的盒子，递给了他。","id":490},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1977_1#1$1","id":491},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌萨斯军官","text":"这是军用加密通讯终端，直接连接到城外的炮兵阵地。","id":492,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌萨斯军官","text":"如果您真的顶不住了......按下这个红色按钮。我们会提供“适量”的火力覆盖。","id":493,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#8$2","id":494},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"什么叫“适量”？我要把整条街都炸平。","id":495},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1977_1#1$1","id":496},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌萨斯军官","text":"那是不可能的。每一发炮弹都有成本，每一寸街道都有产权——即使是卡托加区。","id":497,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#8$2","id":498},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"那源石弩箭呢？还有炸药，这些你们总搬得动吧？","id":499},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1977_1#1$1","id":500},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌萨斯军官","text":"都在这儿了。","id":501,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":502},{"type":"text","text":"巴普洛维奇这才注意到，军官提着两个不大的皮箱。","id":503},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1977_1#1$1","id":504},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌萨斯军官","text":"这也是为了防止这些武器落入暴徒手中，毕竟当初给过您那么多东西，都让学生捡了。我们必须控制风险。","id":505,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#8$2","id":506},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"我......我为你们干了那么多脏活，你们就......","id":507},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1977_1#1$1","id":508},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌萨斯军官","text":"枢密官大人，我们这三十人都是精锐，可以供您差遣，已能体现老爷们的诚意了。","id":509,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌萨斯军官","text":"而且我想，您低估了您手中的“武器”。按下它，乌萨斯就会赐予您无上的“荣耀”......","id":510,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":511},{"type":"text","text":"这位枢密官呆站在原地，分辨着这句话的意思，渗出汗的手掌还攥着那个冰冷的通讯器。","id":512},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#7$2","id":513},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"对......我不能放弃希望，他们会救我的，我能打败那些乌合之众......","id":514},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#8$2","id":515},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"来人！","id":516},{"type":"dialog","id":517},{"type":"charslot","id":518},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2166_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":519},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":520},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“十六勇士”暴徒","text":"大人，您喊我们？","id":521},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#8$2","id":522},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"你们还有多少人能动？","id":523},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2166_1#1$1","id":524},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“十六勇士”暴徒","text":"大概......三四百？","id":525},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#8$2","id":526},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"比对面多就行，让他们全部起来热身，很快他们就能为格罗莫夫报仇了！","id":527},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2166_1#1$1","id":528},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“十六勇士”暴徒","text":"好！","id":529},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#8$2","id":530},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"你，在门口埋点炸药，他们若是敢冲进来，我就拉着所有人一起去见伊戈尔大帝！","id":531},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":532},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安保队长","text":"这......","id":533},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#8$2","id":534},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"至于上尉，我需要你们去对付所谓的无缚者同盟。","id":535},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"不要低估敌人，我和他们在这里对抗了两个月，虽然他们人数不多，但经验丰富。","id":536},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"最重要的是，他们对贵族一律格杀......不要对这种人有幻想，议会也不会想放他们出去。","id":537},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1977_1#1$1","id":538},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌萨斯军官","text":"遵命，枢密官大人。","id":539,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":540},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":541},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_armycrowd","id":542},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":543},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1977_1#1$1","id":544},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌萨斯军官","text":"如果我没听错的话......有人来了。","id":545,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#1$2","id":546},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"......出发。","id":547},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"是时候去给这些小毛头一点教训了。","id":548},{"type":"dialog","id":549},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":550},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":551},{"type":"bgeffect","id":552},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":553},{"type":"hidecgitem","id":554},{"type":"image","id":555},{"type":"charslot","text":"","id":556}],"characters":["尤拉","乌克西克","安托沙","马特维","兴奋的学生","烈夏","凛冬","谨慎的学生","？？？","巴普洛维奇","安保队长","乌萨斯军官","“十六勇士”暴徒"]}